msgid "Place this over the skill button, bind a key and aim with the mouse"
msgstr "把控件对准游戏的技能按钮，绑定按键后用鼠标瞄准"

#: waydroid_helper/controller/widgets/base/cast_cancel_button.py:23
msgctxt "Controller Widgets"
msgid "Place this over the game's cancel target and bind a key or button to cancel a cast"
msgstr "把控件对准游戏里的取消施法位置，再绑定取消键"

#: waydroid_helper/controller/widgets/components/macro.py:687
msgctxt "Controller Widgets"
msgid "Open the control settings to enter macro commands, then bind a key or button to run them"
msgstr "打开控件设置填写宏命令，再绑定执行宏的按键"

#: waydroid_helper/controller/widgets/components/analog_stick.py:36
msgid "Place the left stick over the game's movement wheel and resize it to fit"
msgstr "把左摇杆对准游戏的移动轮盘，拖动边缘使两者大小一致"

#: waydroid_helper/controller/widgets/components/analog_stick.py:190
msgid "Place the right stick where you swipe to turn the camera"
msgstr "把右摇杆放到游戏里滑动转动视角的区域"

#: waydroid_helper/controller/widgets/base/placed_path.py:13
msgid "Press the key or button that should replay this swipe"
msgstr "按下要绑定的按键，就能用它重放这条滑动轨迹"

#: waydroid_helper/controller/widgets/base/trigger_path.py:16
msgid "Squeeze the trigger you want to bind to this path"
msgstr "扣下要绑定到这条路径的扳机"

