msgstr "已清除虚拟定位"

msgid "Virtual location set"
msgstr "已设置虚拟定位"

msgid "Some map tiles could not be loaded."
msgstr "部分地图未能加载。"

msgid "This device already uses a different GNSS driver."
msgstr "此设备已在使用其他 GNSS 驱动。"

msgid "Open Virtual location to install the GNSS driver for this device."
msgstr "打开「虚拟定位」即可为此设备安装 GNSS 驱动。"

msgid "The GNSS driver did not start on this device."
msgstr "此设备的 GNSS 驱动未能启动。"

msgid "Could not check the GNSS driver."
msgstr "无法检查 GNSS 驱动状态。"

msgid "The GNSS driver is available for Android 13 on x86_64 and ARM64."
msgstr "GNSS 驱动支持 x86_64 和 ARM64 架构的 Android 13。"

msgid "Could not download the GNSS driver. Check your connection and try again."
msgstr "无法下载 GNSS 驱动。请检查网络连接后重试。"

msgid "The GNSS driver download failed its integrity check."
msgstr "下载的 GNSS 驱动未通过完整性校验。"

msgid "Administrator authorization was not granted."
msgstr "未取得管理员授权。"

msgid "Could not install the GNSS driver."
msgstr "无法安装 GNSS 驱动。"

msgid "Update the GNSS driver?"
msgstr "更新 GNSS 定位驱动？"

msgid "The installed GNSS driver reports incorrect dates. Updating it will restart this Android device and close open Android apps."
msgstr "已安装的 GNSS 驱动上报的日期有误。更新将重启此 Android 设备并关闭已打开的 Android 应用。"

msgid "Update and restart"
msgstr "更新并重启"

msgid "Install the GNSS driver?"
msgstr "安装 GNSS 定位驱动？"

msgid "Virtual location needs a GNSS driver. Waydroid Helper will download it, ask for administrator authorization, and restart this Android device to install it. Open Android apps will close."
msgstr "虚拟定位需要安装 GNSS 驱动。Waydroid Helper 会下载驱动，请求管理员授权，然后重启当前 Android 设备以完成安装。此设备上打开的应用将会关闭。"

msgid "Install and restart"
msgstr "安装并重启"

msgid "Downloading the GNSS driver…"
msgstr "正在下载 GNSS 驱动…"

msgid "The device session changed. Please try again."
msgstr "设备会话已变更，请重试。"
